				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${K}_{i}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M48"><mml:msub><mml:mi>K</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="13550_2024_1080_Article_IEq48.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> from the full kinetic analyses using the irreversible two-tissue compartment model, <bold>b</bold> Bland&#x02013;Altman analysis of difference vs. average, <bold>c</bold> Correlation between <inline-formula id="IEq49"><alternatives><tex-math id="M49">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
