				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${K}_{i}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M52"><mml:msub><mml:mi>K</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="13550_2024_1080_Article_IEq20.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> images (TBR(<inline-formula id="IEq21"><alternatives><tex-math id="M53">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
