				\begin{document}$${K}_{i}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M68"><mml:msub><mml:mi>K</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="13550_2024_1080_Article_IEq27.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> images (Fig.&#x000a0;<xref rid="Fig7" ref-type="fig">7</xref>). Analyses of [<sup>18</sup>F]FES kinetics in liver metastases were not possible due to spill-in from liver tissue. Background activity in liver tissue was reduced in <inline-formula id="IEq28"><alternatives><tex-math id="M69">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
