				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${K}_{i}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M70"><mml:msub><mml:mi>K</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="13550_2024_1080_Article_IEq28.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> images, however this did not aid in the detection of liver metastases. Several different appearances of liver metastases were noticed (Fig.&#x000a0;<xref rid="Fig8" ref-type="fig">8</xref>). Lesions with a diameter&#x02009;&#x0003e;&#x02009;15&#x000a0;mm and a necrotic center on contrast-enhanced&#x000a0;CT (CE-CT), appeared as cold spots in both SUV and <inline-formula id="IEq29"><alternatives><tex-math id="M71">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
