				\begin{document}$${K}_{i}$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M72"><mml:msub><mml:mi>K</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="13550_2024_1080_Article_IEq29.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula> images. A few lesions had increased values on <inline-formula id="IEq30"><alternatives><tex-math id="M73">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
